  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Me irregular, you and him regular",
   "texto": [
    "Many verbs change only in the form of **eu** (I): **digo** (I say), **venho** (come), **ouço** (hear), **ponho** (put), **dou** (give).",
    "The other people follow a similar pattern: **dizes**, **diz** (say); **vens**, **vem** (come)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "See and hear",
   "texto": [
    "**Ouvir** (hear): **ouço**, **ouves**, **ouve**.",
    "**Ver** (see): **vejo** (I see), **vês** (you see), **vê** (he sees). **dar** is also irregular: **dou**, **dás**, **dá**."
   ]
  },
